  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt=int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    p=[0]\r\n    for x in a:\r\n        p.append(p[-1]+x)\r\n    ans=0\r\n    for x in range(n+1):\r\n        lo=0\r\n        hi=n-x\r\n        while lo<hi:\r\n            y=(lo+hi)//2\r\n            d=a[x+2*y]+a[x+2*y+1]-3*a[3*n-2*x-y-1]\r\n            if d>=0:\r\n                lo=y+1 \r\n            else:\r\n                hi=y  \r\n        y=lo \r\n        cur=2*p[x]+p[x+2*y]+3*p[3*n-2*x-y]\r\n        ans=max(ans,cur)\r\n    print(ans)",
